# FB Archive

Welcome to the FB Archive! Here's where I put all the things I find about FB/YSY and just, well... archive them all

Everything is fully organized by folders and subfolders, and may contain manhua and donghua screenshots, fanarts and official artworks.

## Important Information

All folders marked with an asterisk (*) contains **spoilers** from the manhua/donghua. View at your our risk.

If you see something that you don't want it to be there, you can contact me on **Discord** (*kaelunyx*) so I can remove it.

